### 2) Descobrir tenants do usuário demo (copie o tenant interno para @tenant_id)
GET {{authserver}}/tenants/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Minhas permissões no tenant interno
GET {{authserver}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/me/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Criar role para o client admin portal
POST {{authserver}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "opentenid-admin-portal",
  "name": "SupportAgent"
}

### 5) Listar roles por tenant + client
GET {{authserver}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/roles?clientId=opentenid-admin-portal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) Vincular permissões à role (copie roleId para @role_id)
POST {{authserver}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/roles/{{role_id}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissionKeys": [
    "tenants.read",
    "users.read"
  ]
}

### 7) Atribuir role a um usuário (copie userId para @user_id; pode usar o "sub" do token)
POST {{authserver}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/users/{{user_id}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": "{{role_id}}"
}
